  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Migrate to Camunda with speed and confidence",
    "splashDescription": "Migrating from legacy and proprietary BPM tools to Camunda is complex, time-intensive, and difficult to scale consistently. MAC is a BPM migration accelerator that transitions legacy and proprietary process models into Camunda-compliant BPMN 2.0. It supports both focused tool migrations and scaled modernization initiatives, reducing manual remodeling effort, migration risk, and time to value.",
